{"title": "Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (attack)", "pageid": 34635, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(attack)", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Melee weapon attacks", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Great_Weapon_Master_All_In.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In.webp/300px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In.webp, /w/images/7/7f/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In.webp/300px-Great_Weapon_Master_All_In.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Great_Weapon_Master_All_In.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack is a weapon action available to characters with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\">Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</a> after killing an enemy or landing a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hit</a> with a melee weapon.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nAs a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>, make a melee attack with your equipped weapon.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd><dt>Damage</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Normal weapon damage</div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Weapon Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Weapon <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Normal weapon range\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Normal weapon range</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_GreatWeaponMaster_BonusAttack</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_GreatWeaponMaster_BonusAttack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_GreatWeaponMaster_BonusAttack\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\nGranted by conditions: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(Condition)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(Condition)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (Condition)\">Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Landing a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hit</a> or killing blow with any other melee weapon attack grants the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(Condition)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack_(Condition)\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack (Condition)\">Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</a>. While this condition is active, a character has access to this attack. Performing the attack removes the condition.</li>\n<li>With a source of extra <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Actions</a> such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fast_Hands\" title=\"Fast Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fast_Hands_Icon.webp/20px-Fast_Hands_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fast_Hands_Icon.webp/30px-Fast_Hands_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fast_Hands_Icon.webp/40px-Fast_Hands_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fast Hands\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Fast_Hands_Icon.webp/20px-Fast_Hands_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Fast_Hands_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fast_Hands\" title=\"Fast Hands\">Fast Hands</a>, it is possible to use this attack multiple times in a round since it has no once-per-turn restriction.</li>\n<li>A kill or critical hit with Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack itself cannot reapply the corresponding condition.</li>\n<li>Despite being part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Weapon Master\">Great Weapon Master</a> feat, this attack can be triggered by and used with any melee weapon, including one-handed weapons. The <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_All_In\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: All In\">All In</a> component of the feat is, however, restricted to weapons wielded with two hands.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041033\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.082 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2793/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41880/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15934/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1451436/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   70.937      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   70.937      1 -total\n 76.59%   54.330     31 Template:Trim\n 17.11%   12.136      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 15.04%   10.668      1 Template:SmSAI\n 14.61%   10.365      6 Template:Icon_text\n 11.84%    8.400      4 Template:Icon_link\n 11.36%    8.059      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.41%    5.964      1 Template:SmPass\n  8.21%    5.822      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34635-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715041033 and revision id 373851. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}